                {
                  "id": "ep-nosotros-body",
                  "kind": "rich_text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Negocio familiar desde 2012, atendiendo como nos gustaría que nos atiendan y haciendo con amor y conciencia los productos de nuestra amada Argentina.\n\nSomos una parrilla de barrio en Glew. Carnes a las brasas, picadas artesanales, empanadas cortadas a cuchillo y escabeches de la casa. Todo hecho acá, como en casa.",
                    "style": {
                      "fontFamily": "\"Inter\", var(--font-inter-body), system-ui, sans-serif",
                      "fontSize": "18px",
                      "lineHeight": "1.7",
                      "textColor": "#1a1512",
                      "maxWidthFree": "640px"
                    },
                    "i18n": {
                      "en": {
                        "text": "A family business since 2012, serving you the way we would like to be served, and making the products of our beloved Argentina with love and care.\n\nWe are a neighbourhood grill in Glew. Meat over the coals, artisan boards, hand-cut empanadas and house pickles. All made here, the way it is made at home."
                      }
                    }
                  },
